# ── Generated pipeline data (never commit) ───────────────────────────────────
# These trees are produced by the run scripts and are large: ~6.5 GB / 100k
# files locally, 2.3 GB on the cluster. They are synced with rsync, not git.
# Paths are hardcoded in the generated run scripts and in models/config.py, so
# the directories themselves must stay where they are.
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/results/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/neb/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/neb_subsurface/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/vibrations/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/adsorption/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/slabs/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/structures/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/slurm_scripts/
Ni_hydrogen/calculation/neb_fix_verification/

